 post as the inbox hand-off:\n  a Direct Post reporting SEND_TO_USER_INBOX keeps polling (never\n  platform_action_required, never the inbox email), and the composer\n  toasts say \"posted to your profile\" rather than \"open your inbox\".\n- Make deliveryMode settings-aware: a Direct Post reports\n  direct_publish through the public API and publish runs; only the\n  inbox hand-off reports platform_inbox.\n- Replace the build-time composer flag with a per-account allowlist so\n  Direct Post is testable in production (d3vbaba@gmail.com) while\n  everyone else stays on the inbox hand-off until the audit passes.\n  NEXT_PUBLIC_TIKTOK_DIRECT_POST=1 still opts local builds in wholesale.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/124c6ea1350bb0acd50cd4d80030f09b864ec1e1","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-08-15T03:54:47Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/11c95f84-2c77-4c8b-9678-ad6cde7b293f?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-08-15T03:54:52.454677348Z","updateTime":"2026-08-15T03:59:15.639895Z","displayName":"build-2026-08-15-001","uid":"9b2e93eb-e4e4-45b3-bbb1-3fa6697f8269","etag":"d5CedkcKykqArCvWih7HYbPFOnjkh2KvirojozT3TOU","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-08-15-003","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-08-15-003","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"marka