ting another\nworkspace. Add accountEntitlements/{uid} — a per-user entitlement that\ngetEffectiveSubscription checks first; an active one applies in every\nworkspace. Falls back to the existing per-workspace + legacy resolution\nwhen absent, so normal Stripe billing is unchanged.\n\nAdd scripts/grant-pro-access.mjs to grant/revoke account-level comps by\nemail (used for Facebook reviewer / tester accounts).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/b41741b71a811ce4a2f236db90338dd1e0e19483","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-06-17T03:32:25Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/0748fc1b-24a3-4504-97a8-1bf7609a40d5?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-06-17T03:32:32.175635704Z","updateTime":"2026-06-17T03:37:15.638904Z","displayName":"build-2026-06-17-005","uid":"81984d14-27f3-4800-819b-197e399a87f7","etag":"4SoDLkCCP1mVbDngwMfX_8CGB6WiJkHFdgzvGiLu0_k","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-06-17-004","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-06-17-004","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID","value":"227206788749","availa