en (which expires and can lapse). channelToProviders('instagram')\nnow falls back to the meta provider, so when there is no live standalone\nInstagram connection, publishing uses the Facebook Page's linked Instagram\nBusiness account via the long-lived (effectively non-expiring) Page token.\n\nThe meta-publishing adapter already keys off connection.provider — a meta\nconnection publishes to graph.facebook.com/{igAccountId}/media with the\nPage token — and getConnectionForChannel only resolves meta when the chosen\nPage actually has a linked IG (hasReadyMetaDestination checks igAccountId).\nNo adapter change needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/d80a1bedaa82add066bc2cabbe71a961b8dd1b72","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-06-17T03:24:00Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/91dfc1c1-b2da-4ac6-8a28-7b6861f93587?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-06-17T03:24:02.807459846Z","updateTime":"2026-06-17T03:27:55.637014Z","displayName":"build-2026-06-17-004","uid":"239e524e-4b5e-4d86-a6e5-9a81fa4558ef","etag":"pD0H-dnoWDkI6Ky5ZBLXR5JGdqPIYK4XWtHCfMMWPwU","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-06-17-007","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-06-17-007","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":