d7bb3d7ceba58af61e17c28","commitMessage":"feat(webhooks): add Meta deauthorize + data-deletion callbacks\n\nMeta won't save the Threads/Facebook/Instagram OAuth config until the\nUninstall and Delete callback URLs are filled, and the app had no\nsigned_request webhook handlers for them.\n\n- POST /api/webhooks/meta/deauthorize (Uninstall callback)\n- POST /api/webhooks/meta/data-deletion (Delete callback) + GET status\n- Verify signed_request (HMAC-SHA256) against meta/instagram/threads\n  app secrets; the matching secret scopes the delete to that provider\n- Collection-group, batched, idempotent deletion of all connections\n  for the app-scoped user (metaUserId / igAccountId / threadsUserId)\n- Persist metaUserId in the meta OAuth callback so Facebook deauths map\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/cb0a1a8ba65751dcad7bb3d7ceba58af61e17c28","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-06-17T02:34:47Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/6d91575b-58d5-4215-bf62-3fffb1a8c1b6?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-06-17T02:34:53.610492817Z","updateTime":"2026-06-17T02:39:26.906124Z","displayName":"build-2026-06-17-001","uid":"c88db64c-b135-47d0-8e66-dbf9308b2740","etag":"wk4SyPDF68QsscwjMNoDS1hdsYNZEzTIDDJrNE3DBig","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-06-17-003","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-06-17-003","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availabil