6e281ab4d29","commitMessage":"fix(integrations): stop Instagram unlinking + unify channel status\n\nInstagram \"unlinked itself\" because the long-lived token exchange\n(ig_exchange_token) was fatal in the OAuth callback — unlike the meta\nand threads branches, which already degrade gracefully — so any failure\nmeant storeTokens never ran and no connection persisted. Make it\nbest-effort: fall back to the short-lived token so the account links.\n\nSettings (\"not linked\") and the product detail sheet (\"connected\")\ncomputed Facebook/Instagram status independently and disagreed when a\nleftover workspace-scoped Meta connection existed (sheet ignored scope,\nSettings required product scope). Extract a single resolveChannelStatus\nhelper and use it on both surfaces so they can never drift.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/f074260204f0cacd650a8887175346e281ab4d29","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-06-17T03:09:05Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/69fc2372-7e90-4ca0-b7a8-7f81548435ec?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-06-17T03:09:08.011695052Z","updateTime":"2026-06-17T03:13:21.085709Z","displayName":"build-2026-06-17-002","uid":"2a08b4c7-a844-4a51-a93c-16a57be91e35","etag":"RcPvOizLnj3zVLgI65A-rnDvFOWIISCnlj1FW0SgHj8","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-08-18-008","state":"BUILDING","config":{},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"12c6dbb0bc469ec82a86523e4e32a569bdcbc2e4","hash":"12c6dbb0bc469ec82a86523e4e32a569bdcbc2e4","commitMessage":"chore(billing): wire live add-on price IDs (extra brand $10/mo, extra seat $5/mo)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/12c6dbb0bc469ec82a86523