iption fallback, analytics windows 30d/1yr/unlimited,\n  truthful feature lists (bulk-scheduling and unenforced brand-voice-count\n  claims removed), add-on catalog (extra brand $10/mo, extra seat $5/mo)\n- Stripe live prices realigned to the advertised $29/$69/$199 set;\n  apphosting.yaml re-pointed (the $39/$99/$299 set is archived)\n\nEnforcement (server-side):\n- Brand limit at product creation; per-brand channel caps at OAuth\n  connect/select via shared assertChannelCapacity guard\n- Free-tier posts quota (15/mo) with reserve/refund; media quota now meters\n  free tier instead of hard-blocking\n- Smart-schedule gated Pro+; team seats include add-on seats\n- Connect create-upload-url now quota-checked (was an unmetered bypass)\n- API key creation and public-API auth require an active subscription\n  (honoring account entitlements for comped users)\n\nBilling hardening:\n- Trial granted once per customer (no recycling via cancel/re-checkout)\n- Checkout returns the billing portal when a live subscription exists\n  (prevents double subscriptions)\n- Webhook syncs add-on item quantities; new /api/stripe/addons endpoint\n\nAlso carries the in-progress Cloud Tasks worker fan-out wiring already in\nthe tree (due-workspaces + @google-cloud/tasks, marked serverExternalPackages\nso Turbopack keeps the gRPC transport external).\n\ntsc clean; 537 tests green; production build green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/fe98bc2f1c20d901cf5a6bfe4f979ab3143296f0","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-08-18T10:50:12Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/0f1d4c56-fe85-42b9-a7e4-13a2589b7667?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-08-18T10:50:16.728283967Z","updateTime":"2026-08-18T10:51:17.496127Z","displayName":"build-2026-08-18-005","uid":"1b5e9232-763b-4243-a2cd-7893b01943e5","etag":"e