tokens (512 → 1024) to allow complete responses\n- Lower temperature (0.2 → 0.1) for more deterministic output\n- Explicit tag format: 1 category + 1 tech/approach + 1 audience + 2 feature tags with hyphen convention\n- Concrete examples for every field (name, description, pricing, tone, audience)\n- Category disambiguation with clear criteria for saas vs web vs api\n- Pricing fallback text when pricing page wasn't loaded\n- Realistic Chrome User-Agent to reduce bot-blocking\n\nText extraction:\n- Increase limit 8k → 12k chars\n- Extract h1/h2/h3 headings separately and prepend them for higher signal density\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/f696c5e10ccba00362d46b8db9f829f22a523644","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-03-14T23:39:55Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/73f45463-bf1c-4e6d-ab73-053f73f9575d?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-03-14T23:39:59.904717913Z","updateTime":"2026-03-14T23:43:52.589730Z","displayName":"build-2026-03-14-009","uid":"b7bfba87-f006-42e8-9f46-933aa49cd9dd","etag":"AYBPBjZamYYcPrRd1OLJhwDZp-JB5Rs69BB7kyntwEA","reconciling":false,"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","errors":[{"error":{"code":13},"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","cloudResource":"https://cloud.google.com/build"}]},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-03-14-008","state":"FAILED","error":{"code":13},"config":{},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"9d79eb875c279d5bd3e4b62b9b6512fdc60f8367","hash":"9d79eb875c279d5bd3e4b62b9b6512fdc60f8367","commitMessage":"feat: ad account selection, rich integration status, AI product scanner with real brand colors\n\n- Wire ad account/customer dropdowns into campaign edit sheet (Meta + Google)\n- Show connected account name, page name, and health status on product cards\n- Replace manual product creation with URL-first AI scan flow: paste URL, scan,\n  confirm prefilled name/description/category/pricing/tags/brand colors\n- Extract real brand colors from logo/favicon using node-vibrant (primary, secondary, accent)\n- Extract logo URL from HTML (apple-touch-icon → raster icon → favicon.ico)\n- Run Gemini text analysis and color extraction in parallel for speed\n- Save accentColor and logoUrl from scan into brand identity on product create\n- Fix Meta connection persistence: use user access token (not page token) for\n  ad account listing; add scope field to integrations API with deduplication\n- Token refresh: preserve tokenExpiresAt and handle permanent error patterns\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/9d79eb875c279d5bd3e4b62b9b6512fdc60f8367","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-03-14T23:12:52Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/23138c1a-4a34-4add-832d-933e1f346b34?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-03-14T23:12:57.471682823Z","updateTime":"2026-03-14T23:16:29.962790Z","displayName":"build-2026-03-14-008","uid":"b0e09919-053c-4e5a-a0be-671f06b1a6c9","etag":"3VXjpZX_aXQAR0qzKAggqOQDix9aZdkV63MwNRWLbqo","reconciling":false,"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","errors":[{"error":{"code":13},"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","cloudResource":"https://cloud.google.com/build"}]},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-08-07-001","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-08-07-001","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},