kTok's PULL_FROM_URL fetcher failed every photo publish with\nphoto_pull_failed while the same proxy route returned a valid JPEG to\nevery client we tested, ByteSpider included. Two properties of the old\nURL shape are known trip-wires for TikTok's puller: the storage URL\nnested inside a query parameter, which URL normalization can mangle\nbefore the fetch, and no image extension on the path.\n\nPhotos now travel through /api/media/tiktok/<base64url(url)>.jpg —\nno query string, extension-terminated, same storage-bucket allowlist,\nSSRF guard, and 1080x1920 JPEG normalization as the original route.\nVideos are unchanged; they upload bytes directly and never pull.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013YWBHjuAkdGLfenpMDiLgy","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/108a13cc9fd7de3820d38cdd35c594ac409cd5e4","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-08-07T17:53:13Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/fc905791-69a5-43be-81bb-adc5d1040bf4?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-08-07T17:53:25.597049621Z","updateTime":"2026-08-07T17:58:09.018927Z","displayName":"build-2026-08-07-002","uid":"6e61bc8e-5d19-44bc-9edb-c01513da9edc","etag":"ZkkI1_JTIHcLNojMQOiupGGmP8vXRTaNHSJAZpQU78o","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-03-24-001","state":"EXPIRED","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-03-24-001","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":4},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro-0226220726.firebaseapp.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTI