nection\n- Jobs executor uses tiktok_ads for ad metrics sync\n- Products page: separate connect buttons for TikTok and TikTok Ads\n- Token refresh includes tiktok_ads connections\n- Secrets list includes new env vars\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/f0e52907c0fd8d1417745028d38b82e708ad5607","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-03-24T05:45:21Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/8c577781-6cd1-46bd-b6b6-cdda50804b3b?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-03-24T05:45:24.101240960Z","updateTime":"2026-05-22T22:41:27.408632Z","displayName":"build-2026-03-24-006","uid":"ed3da99d-8c63-4086-9c99-bc938274ad78","etag":"fK3-RcXGvdQdzIpR79eHcjtX7Pquk_Xz5fMU_ttyYyI","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-03-24-007","state":"FAILED","error":{"code":9,"message":"Error resolving secret version with name=projects/markaestro-0226220726/secrets/TIKTOK_ADS_CLIENT_KEY/versions/latest. Please ensure the secret exists in your project and that your App Hosting backend has access to it. If the secret already exists in your project, please grant your App Hosting backend access to it with the CLI command 'firebase apphosting:secrets:grantaccess'. See https://firebase.google.com/docs/app-hosting/configure#secret-parameters for more information.","details":[{"@type":"type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo","reason":"fah/misconfigured-secret","metadata":{"attribution":"USER","user_facing_reason":"Misconfigured Secret","user_facing_message":"Error resolving secret version with name=projects/markaestro-0226220726/secrets/TIKTOK_ADS_CLIENT_KEY/versions/latest. Please ensure the secret exists in your project and that your App Hosting backend has access to it. If the secret already exists in your project, please grant your App Hosting backend access to it with the CLI command 'firebase apphosting:secrets:grantaccess'. See https://firebase.google.com/docs/app-hosting/configure#secret-parameters for more information."}}]},"config":{},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"c78713a16e3fcf3c9f50591a352e8aee60761924","hash":"c78713a16e3fcf3c9f50591a352e8aee60761924","commitMessage":"Wire TikTok Ads secrets in apphosting.yaml, remove old X secrets\n\nAdd TIKTOK_ADS_CLIENT_KEY and TIKTOK_ADS_CLIENT_SECRET to the\nApp Hosting config. Remove X_CLIENT_ID and X_CLIENT_SECRET since\nX integration was removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/c78713a16e3fcf3c9f50591a352e8aee60761924","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-03-24T05:54:32Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/0f55e6ab-2d41-4679-8d5a-e222a0b1ecba?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-03-24T05:54:34.419012708Z","updateTime":"2026-03-24T05:55:14.907754Z","displayName":"build-2026-03-24-007","uid":"124151e0-dd28-4cc2-a25d-70de86581d8d","etag":"r2YW79bhHIET1-v3g5so7DR2owR6ATq_rFFMgRnkWxQ","reconciling":false,"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","errors":[{"error":{"code":9,"message":"Error resolving secret version with name=projects/markaestro-0226220726/secrets/TIKTOK_ADS_CLIENT_KEY/versions/latest. Please ensure the secret exists in your project and that your App Hosting backend has access to it. If the secret already exists in your project, please grant your App Hosting backend access to it with the CLI command 'firebase apphosting:secrets:grantaccess'. See https://firebase.google.com/docs/app-hosting/configure#secret-parameters for more information.","details":[{"@type":"type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo","reason":"fah/misconfigured-secret","metadata":{"attribution":"USER","user_fa