yName":"61fa16ca3514e1ff0d1de33b979cdce7b38b4dc2","hash":"61fa16ca3514e1ff0d1de33b979cdce7b38b4dc2","commitMessage":"Fix TikTok OAuth: separate Marketing API auth flow from content API\n\nTikTok Marketing API uses completely different OAuth endpoints and\nparameters than the content API:\n- Auth URL: business-api.tiktok.com/portal/auth (not tiktok.com/v2/auth)\n- Token exchange: JSON body with app_id/secret/auth_code (not form-urlencoded)\n- Callback param: auth_code (not code)\n- No scopes in auth URL (granted at app level)\n- Returns advertiser_ids in token response\n\nUpdated generateAuthUrl() and exchangeCode() to handle tiktok_ads\nas a special case. Callback route now reads auth_code parameter\nand merges advertiserId into connection metadata.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/61fa16ca3514e1ff0d1de33b979cdce7b38b4dc2","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-03-24T06:02:49Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/c0f960b8-dcdf-4ea1-993f-8f00964b7b38?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-03-24T06:02:51.199602681Z","updateTime":"2026-03-24T06:03:31.712391Z","displayName":"build-2026-03-24-008","uid":"0c7185d9-d208-4ddb-ab4c-66832b2a4406","etag":"lOgd8LEu4NtEp26DNFb9FRJNt2GqSe-5nCYJvD0583I","reconciling":false,"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","errors":[{"error":{"code":9,"message":"Error resolving secret version with name=projects/markaestro-0226220726/secrets/TIKTOK_ADS_CLIENT_KEY/versions/latest. Please ensure the secret exists in your project and that your App Hosting backend has access to it. If the secret already exists in your project, please grant your App Hosting backend access to it with the CLI command 'firebase apphosting:secrets:grantaccess'. See https://firebase.google.com/docs/app-hosting/configure#secret-parameters for more information.","det