e08\",\"appId\":\"1:227206788749:web:dea0c199026903c4cdd4c4\",\"authDomain\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebaseapp.com\",\"databaseURL\":\"\",\"messagingSenderId\":\"227206788749\",\"projectId\":\"markaestro-0226220726\",\"storageBucket\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"NG_TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS","value":"X-Forwarded-Host","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"NG_ALLOWED_HOSTS","value":"markaestro-227206788749.us-central1.run.app,markaestro-auwks5pljq-uc.a.run.app,t-3334189410---markaestro-auwks5pljq-uc.a.run.app,markaestro--markaestro-0226220726.us-central1.hosted.app","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"469d0abc7d43e4a933b1ce0b85196cc880e3e5f3","hash":"469d0abc7d43e4a933b1ce0b85196cc880e3e5f3","commitMessage":"fix: record every credential rejection, and add the missing disconnect label\n\nTwo problems visible on one screen.\n\nThe Disconnect buttons rendered the raw key\n`products.detailSheet.channels.disconnect`: `disconnectAllCount` existed\nbut the singular `disconnect` never did, so next-intl echoed the path.\nAdded in all 11 locales, worded to match each locale's existing\n\"Disconnect all {count}\". A scan of every useTranslations scope against\nthe message files confirms this was the only key missing anywhere.\n\nPawBloom's Threads posts failed while the channel showed \"Linked\".\nProbing Graph with the stored token returns code 190 — \"You cannot access\nthe app till you log in to www.threads.com and follow the instructions\ngiven\" — so the token is dead, but the connection still read\nstatus=connected with no error, and scheduled token refresh will not look\nat it until the 60-day expiry in October.\n\nPublishing recorded auth failures only for LinkedIn, Facebook and\nInstagram, each with its own regex; Threads matched none of them, so\nnothing marked the connection. Replaced those three blocks with one check\nshared by every channel: a rejected credential is now recorded wherever it\ncomes from, so a channel stops advertising itself as ready. Matching is\ndeliberately narrow — content problems, rate limits and outages must not\ndisable a healthy connection — and the platform's own message is kept\nbecause it is usually the most actionable thing available, as Threads'\nis here. TikTok still gets its refresh-and-retry before a rejection counts.\n\nAGENTS.md/CLAUDE.md are generated by `next dev`; committing them keeps\nthe tree clean, as the generated note itself instructs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/469d0abc7d43e4a933b1ce0b85196cc880e3e5f3","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-08-09T17:48:10Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/b4dfb9cb-e104-4d76-8265-5505245b5bb0?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-08-09T17:48:13.286486142Z","updateTime":"2026-08-09T17:52:22.190731Z","displayName":"build-2026-08-09-008","uid":"a4c6facd-308d-4474-a397-57de603bf740","etag":"vpH_yyO6ElfPo_bIDwPjt75g8-0l-aym4Vo6LifNTzA","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-08-09-009","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-08-09-009","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIR