pp,markaestro-auwks5pljq-uc.a.run.app,t-3334189417---markaestro-auwks5pljq-uc.a.run.app,markaestro--markaestro-0226220726.us-central1.hosted.app","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"adce926570e739c1f376a7f2d12a4ee730e6b242","hash":"adce926570e739c1f376a7f2d12a4ee730e6b242","commitMessage":"fix: add language picker to the app's persistent header\n\nThe only locale switcher in the authenticated app lived inside\nSettings -> Account, so translated pages had no visible way to\nchange language. Add a compact variant to AppLocaleSwitcher\n(Globe icon + dropdown, mirroring the marketing site's picker)\nand wire it into Header.tsx so it's reachable from every app page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F762Pk8pUwVRx68P3doiNN","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/adce926570e739c1f376a7f2d12a4ee730e6b242","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-08-09T07:01:36Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/659c369e-d1f5-4e88-8f2d-cb3f5379c58f?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-08-09T07:01:38.485711480Z","updateTime":"2026-08-09T07:06:30.217019Z","displayName":"build-2026-08-09-003","uid":"d70018c7-d466-4e40-9ca6-a5ba9e286f4a","etag":"FjRK3NGNguScfdEvtWXWXb37N0vU3vb_eLGqRUMVM4Y","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-08-09-001","state":"FAILED","error":{"code":13},"config":{},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"6bea915be3c31a79f2c554fab277ff2ea8be3fad","hash":"6bea915be3c31a79f2c554fab277ff2ea8be3fad","commitMessage":"feat(i18n): translate marketing, app, RTL support, and emails into 10 languages\n\nFull internationalization of Markaestro into es, fr, de, pt-BR, ja, zh, ko,\nit, nl, and ar (plus en default), delivered in four phases:\n\nPhase 1 — marketing site + legal pages under a new src/app/[locale] tree,\nnext-intl routing/middleware composition, locale switcher, RTL+font setup.\n\nPhase 2 — the entire authenticated app (dashboard, settings, onboarding,\ncalendar, content/composer, products, analytics, guides, auth pages, and\nevery shared component) with per-surface message namespaces and a\nserver-resolved locale (member doc preference, falling back to\nAccept-Language) since the (app) tree carries no URL locale segment.\n\nPhase 3 — app-wide RTL support for Arabic: fixed the root layout only\nresolving locale/dir for the [locale] marketing tree (silently staying\nltr/en for the entire app), wired Radix's Direction.Provider so every\ndropdown/dialog/sheet/select resolves align=\"start\"/\"end\" correctly,\nconverted physical-direction Tailwind utilities to logical properties\nthroughout, mirrored directional icons and animations, and reversed\nRecharts axes for RTL locales.\n\nPhase 4 — transactional emails (sign-in code, email change, manual-publish\nand TikTok-inbox reminders, team invites) now render in the recipient's\nlocale via next-intl's createTranslator outside of any request/component\ntree, with per-recipient locale grouping for batched sends and the team\ninvite email upgraded to the shared branded template.\n\nAlso fixed along the way: a locale-prefix bug where every \"Get Started\"/\n\"Sign In\" link on non-English marketing pages 404'd because next-intl's\nLink doesn't know some routes ((app) tree) are never locale-prefixed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F762Pk8pUwVRx68P3doiNN","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/6bea915be3c31a79f2c554fab277ff2ea8be3fad","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-08-09T06:35:18Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-centra