e\nduring render rather than in an effect so it costs a single extra pass.\nA vanishing param is ignored, so clicking a tab in the page is not undone\nby the URL that no longer names it.\n\nThis affected every ?tab= deep link into Settings from within Settings,\nnot just workspaces.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/1d68db198851d422df4e7f8238e48630cd483bdf","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-08-09T07:04:43Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/f77f7439-c83e-490a-87d1-6287ba51b0c3?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-08-09T07:04:46.563863289Z","updateTime":"2026-08-09T07:10:10.185514Z","displayName":"build-2026-08-09-004","uid":"838c89b6-0eb9-45be-8d65-69009c0e59fb","etag":"jAluxyWe-AKU9mtkU6LOSj4t-ZiKSJ50Hc-Vj_C-PDE","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-08-09-005","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-08-09-005","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID","value":"227206788749","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_APP_ID","value":"1:227206788749:web:3b4e8c1b6e9bfeb1cdd4c4","availa