oduct\nfilter into the Firestore query (query.ts + export path), with a matching\nvalidate-firestore-queries check.\n\nMetrics poller: retry partial fetches that hit auth/transient errors with\ncapped backoff instead of marking them complete.\n\nTikTok: capture publiclyAvailablePostId as the analytics externalId and\npersist tiktokPublicPostId; request user.info.stats for audience snapshots.\n\ndiagnose-meta-connections: redact tokens/secrets in probe output.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/f728a944c54a52347f9204952dd15dc8615f83d3","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-07-09T03:07:30Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/b9372ec7-6fc1-429c-9aca-1b1bd3be5fa8?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-07-09T03:07:37.468660870Z","updateTime":"2026-07-09T03:12:20.745444Z","displayName":"build-2026-07-09-001","uid":"5c894750-dacf-439e-98fb-0b3c772ec327","etag":"6E97PSvEKDsEBmfaTDD-qsXs-0p3zLk7HQNQs5EeEb4","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-07-09-005","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-07-09-005","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE