w sticking at days=0 on load\n\ngetLimit('analyticsWindowDays') returns 0 until the subscription\nstatus finishes loading. The range clamp treated that transient 0 as a\nreal limit: `maxDays !== -1 && days > maxDays` was true (0 !== -1 &&\n28 > 0), and the fallback `widest?.days ?? maxDays` resolved to 0, so\n`days` was forced to 0. Because the clamp only ever shrinks `days`, it\nnever recovered once the real limit arrived — leaving the page issuing\n`/api/analytics?days=0` (the server masked this via `parseInt || 28`),\nno range preset highlighted, and every preset briefly shown as locked.\n\nNow the clamp waits for a loaded, positive/unlimited limit before\ntouching `days` and never falls back to 0; the preset \"locked\" state\nlikewise ignores the maxDays=0 loading window.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/8ff1cac589197df76903ac25905ef427ac516722","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-07-09T17:04:19Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/f766c802-e894-4edd-94cc-ff887e824d24?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-07-09T17:04:21.876149035Z","updateTime":"2026-07-09T17:08:34.961950Z","displayName":"build-2026-07-09-005","uid":"6226ec12-539d-4c02-96e1-f9724ffa1721","etag":"YWylqvnoRSkUv0ZGFg-z-bKRJ94XNZMBflwe5apjs58","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-07-09-004","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-07-09-004","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availabili