leads with lifestyle product-in-use (creative drives 70-80%\nof Meta ad performance per Billo). Variant pools in image-generator are now\nbiased per channel and the Style dropdown reorders + auto-promotes based on\nthe active channel.\n\nNew TikTok Photo Mode story slideshow generator: plans a 5-10 slide carousel\nusing PAS+CTA / listicle / transformation / storytime / mythbusting story\nframeworks, generates per-slide UGC images in parallel, returns hook line,\ncaption, hashtags, and per-slide overlay text + story beat. Wired into\nTikTokVideoTab as a 4th format with its own short Product->Story->Generate\nflow. Photo Mode carousels average +12% engagement vs video per Socialinsider.\n\nAlso includes prior unrelated work-in-progress on Meta ad import and\npublishing adapters.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/1152f9d2490100dc3c585f593213613a15a25be5","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-07T05:55:58Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/b193b069-9776-4115-9ecc-facf502907ee?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-04-07T05:56:03.390562281Z","updateTime":"2026-04-07T05:59:46.132053Z","displayName":"build-2026-04-07-004","uid":"67ee1266-ad7a-45fd-8021-9dd9d5fedd81","etag":"1ePxmEoSNYJ_DJqULcu3yA42NdP4rlJ57-c1W4mAXw8","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-04-07-005","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-04-07-005","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":4},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","a