 post to a draft (ignores scheduledAt),\n  so the worker never auto-publishes it — both native and Connect surfaces.\n- POST /api/public/v1/posts/:id/publish rejects TikTok\n  (VALIDATION_TIKTOK_PUBLISH_VIA_APP_ONLY). TikTok is finalized/published from\n  the Markaestro app exactly as a creator does by hand.\n\nDocs:\n- /developers/api: Connect API moved to the top as 'Recommended'; native\n  reframed as 'Advanced: full Public API'; all TikTok copy updated to draft-only.\n- PUBLIC_API.md: Connect featured up top; TikTok channel rule + publish behavior\n  rewritten to draft-only; SlideSmith MARKAESTRO.md unaffected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/3e6cf050dfe57ac689412b3cf863e36e18fee8e0","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-06-15T22:13:12Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/8ed955bf-c31b-4ca2-be5c-932b0c9b5f4a?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-06-15T22:13:15.741946638Z","updateTime":"2026-06-15T22:18:09.261209Z","displayName":"build-2026-06-15-011","uid":"869b4dd6-4890-4291-9e8a-ed972d84c590","etag":"nhz7L4rJb48y3UA663W0iYz-Qu65qyyAUmOglOAZEtE","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-06-15-012","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-06-15-012","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":