t a 'redirecting' flag on success.\n- Mobile sign-in didn't reach the dashboard. The __session cookie was host-only,\n  so it didn't carry across the apex↔subdomain split (markaestro.com ↔\n  app.markaestro.com) — mobile OAuth bounces through the apex authDomain, leaving\n  the proxy auth guard to bounce back to /login. The cookie now sets\n  Domain=.markaestro.com when the request host is under the marketing domain\n  (host-only on localhost / preview / *.hosted.app, so no regression there).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/8cc3becfe6e4fa64eb7b65ae6babd4aa9cacb51a","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-06-15T23:18:23Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/4570378f-a155-47c6-83fa-6e8511b0ef36?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-06-15T23:20:23.986849120Z","updateTime":"2026-06-15T23:24:57.777258Z","labels":{"deployment-tool":"cli-firebase"},"uid":"7c17f51d-2c99-4ef6-8a34-b6ef903f14c2","etag":"ZDWw1Gc1PgpV0ibSu_Dyh3UenQaM5jvfwLepksPEPVE","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-06-15-003","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-06-15-003","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app","availability":["BUILD","RUN