h elite copywriting + add image subtypes for visual control\n\nContent generation overhaul:\n- Rewrite SYSTEM_PROMPT with 10 creative hook types (cold open, pattern\n  interrupt, identity hook, emotional mirror, bold claim, etc.)\n- Add mandatory CTA rules — every post must end with a specific,\n  compelling call to action with varied formats\n- Upgrade channel constraints with engagement tactics and CTA examples\n- Pipeline posts now mandate different hook types and CTA per post\n\nImage subtypes:\n- Add 12 visual categories: product-hero, lifestyle, flat-lay,\n  texture-detail, before-after, hands-in-action, environment,\n  still-life, silhouette, behind-the-scenes, ingredients-raw,\n  mood-abstract\n- Single posts: dropdown selector in CreateTab (default: Auto/Random)\n- Campaigns: multi-select checkbox panel — selected subtypes cycle\n  across pipeline posts guaranteeing visual variety\n- Each subtype has detailed scene direction that overrides random\n  selection when chosen\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/e60944dec48c6f6aa2e24589720878133e71417f","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-03-26T00:20:40Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/f6e528e1-2c39-463b-b7b1-4c2ad4c87fb2?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-03-26T00:20:42.269122288Z","updateTime":"2026-05-22T22:41:27.408632Z","displayName":"build-2026-03-26-002","uid":"fb3560ef-7490-458d-8b54-d19f53c2abd1","etag":"PRbAbyh3jXlTOFBSuGihF6oDxzAN7cx9rmlnTBZr0Qc","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-03-26-003","state":"EXPIRED","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-03-26-003","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concurrency":80,"maxIn