publish pipeline hardening\n\nPhase 6 — wizard/sheet interior design polish:\n\nCampaignWizard:\n- Sheet header switched from font-display serif title to mk-eyebrow +\n  22px semibold title (context-aware \"Build a pipeline\" / \"Ship a\n  single post\"), 13px description with tight letter-spacing.\n- Step rail section grounded on --mk-surface with hairline borders.\n- Footer progress dots replaced tailwind w-6/w-1.5 + bg-foreground with\n  3px ink-filled pills sized by state, paper color-mix backdrop.\n- TypeCard ink/paper swap for the active selection, panel fill for\n  the glyph tile, ink-border on selection, paper-tinted hint text.\n- Summary block migrated to --mk-surface + mk-eyebrow.\n\nProductCreateWizard:\n- Sheet header pattern aligned with CampaignWizard (eyebrow + 22px\n  semibold title + 13px description).\n- Scan-your-website card re-grounded on --mk-surface with a panel\n  glyph tile and token typography.\n- \"or\" divider now the mk hairline + eyebrow pattern used elsewhere.\n- Manual-entry card moved to --mk-paper + --mk-rule with ink body,\n  ink-40 chevron that slides on hover, tokenized icon tile.\n- Brand-intelligence panel on --mk-surface with mk-eyebrow.\n- Footer bar on --mk-surface, buttons normalized to rounded-lg h-9\n  13px.\n\nPostEditSheet:\n- Header now eyebrow (channel label) + 22px semibold title pattern;\n  dropped the old Badge chip and its import.\n- AI image panel grounded on --mk-surface + hairline border.\n- Footer gains hairline border + rounded-lg h-9 13px buttons.\n- All \"text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider\n  text-muted-foreground\" labels collapsed to the mk-eyebrow utility.\n\nScheduleSheet:\n- Header pattern standardized (mk-eyebrow + 22px semibold title +\n  13px description, bordered).\n\nTikTok publish pipeline:\n- /api/posts/[id]/publish and /api/public/v1/posts/[id]/publish now\n  short-poll the TikTok inbox transcode inline before returning so\n  the client sees a final status (exported_for_review / published /\n  failed) even when the Cloud Scheduler poll worker isn't running.\n- Clears stale scheduledAt when marking a post `publishing` so the\n  UI doesn't flash a \"Scheduled\" badge on a post that's live-publishing.\n- Expanded tiktok-publish-poll-worker with proper retry semantics.\n- Added /api/integrations/tiktok/diagnose route and a local\n  scripts/check-last-tiktok-post.mjs helper for debugging inbox state.\n- CreateTab polls just-published posts to terminal status without\n  needing a manual refresh.\n- PostCard + publish-runs receive the accompanying UI/API tweaks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/f2428bd2c47ad4f0a1e944d418107744a2eac978","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-23T09:13:18Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/da047f65-2ce0-4c6c-99a5-9727ff6c18ae?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-04-23T09:13:21.599217711Z","updateTime":"2026-04-23T09:18:15.132295Z","displayName":"build-2026-04-23-008","uid":"4d773786-8904-4015-9903-54a46ffa3634","etag":"QxtNE0f7oEfJQy1Zm58W3dUMB5MmxKi37aLuHZqWGLc","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-04-23-009","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-04-23-009","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10,"minInstances":1},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_