hat product. Fits the one-channel-per-product model.\n\n- New IntegrationsTab: lists products (/api/products), per-product connection\n  status via /api/integrations?productIds=, Link runs the product-scoped OAuth\n  (authorize?productId=&returnTo=/settings?tab=integrations), Unlink calls\n  disconnect with { productId }.\n- Meta page picker: when a Meta connection exposes multiple Facebook Pages, a\n  dialog lets the user pick the Page (and its linked Instagram) for that product\n  (/api/oauth/pages/meta + /select).\n- OAuth callback now honors returnTo for per-product connects (returns to the\n  Settings → Integrations tab instead of always /products).\n- All OAuth/connection backend already supported productId scoping; this is a\n  UI build plus the one callback returnTo tweak.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/2630453627ba6bb4d3b1249269a6a8d791da83b5","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-06-16T00:36:07Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/ec59ee5b-8be3-4dff-8ce0-aab41d066ccd?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-06-16T00:36:10.258420927Z","updateTime":"2026-06-16T00:39:42.738254Z","displayName":"build-2026-06-16-003","uid":"0064d25f-1451-496e-b94f-8e02c14ddf09","etag":"Xj1BOjtqMhzl7oEBiioCGwkJd0DD3u1IxIveicmTPDk","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-06-16-004","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-06-16-004","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestr