9\",\"projectId\":\"markaestro-0226220726\",\"storageBucket\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"NG_TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS","value":"X-Forwarded-Host","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"NG_ALLOWED_HOSTS","value":"markaestro-227206788749.us-central1.run.app,markaestro-auwks5pljq-uc.a.run.app,t-2021406517---markaestro-auwks5pljq-uc.a.run.app,markaestro--markaestro-0226220726.us-central1.hosted.app","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"01b35706f91cbe88f847d8cb454c6ec6fa32552f","hash":"01b35706f91cbe88f847d8cb454c6ec6fa32552f","commitMessage":"feat(integrations): fully separated per-product account linking\n\nEach product now links its own individual account per channel — nothing shared.\n\n- Meta is per-product: authorize requires productId; the callback stores the\n  user token + chosen Page on the product's own connection (no shared\n  workspace-level Meta login). Page picker + select use the product-level token.\n- Facebook and Instagram are separate: Meta provides only Facebook; Instagram is\n  its own Instagram Login connection. channelToProviders('instagram') no longer\n  falls back to Meta, and buildMetaDestinations no longer emits an Instagram\n  destination from the Page's linked IG.\n- getMetaConnectionMerged resolves to the product-level connection only.\n- Disconnect revokes+deletes the product's own connection (incl. Meta); token\n  refresh covers product-level Meta.\n- Settings → Integrations UI: 4 separate per-product channels (Facebook,\n  Instagram, TikTok, Threads); the Meta Page picker is scoped to the product.\n- Existing shared-Meta connections are ignored by the new UI and re-linked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/01b35706f91cbe88f847d8cb454c6ec6fa32552f","author":{"displayNam