ction only.\n- Disconnect revokes+deletes the product's own connection (incl. Meta); token\n  refresh covers product-level Meta.\n- Settings → Integrations UI: 4 separate per-product channels (Facebook,\n  Instagram, TikTok, Threads); the Meta Page picker is scoped to the product.\n- Existing shared-Meta connections are ignored by the new UI and re-linked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/01b35706f91cbe88f847d8cb454c6ec6fa32552f","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-06-16T00:59:36Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/33b4e84a-8805-4e64-a255-0004bd9033f8?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-06-16T00:59:49.528806052Z","updateTime":"2026-06-16T01:04:23.255596Z","labels":{"deployment-tool":"cli-firebase"},"uid":"d04649b6-6479-486a-a420-01217d9e0037","etag":"x8_GVhytpeoVWltIYoKmA2YP7IOVPNiTkMV1X4LlaxU","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-06-16-007","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-06-16-007","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID","value":"227206788749","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT