 model:\n- Meta card is now a per-product 'Facebook' link (its own Facebook login + product-\n  scoped Page picker + Unlink), not the old shared-workspace 'Meta (Facebook +\n  Instagram)' that told users to connect in Settings.\n- Instagram is its own independent link (Instagram Login). Only product-scoped\n  connections count (leftover workspace Meta is ignored).\n- Page picker fetches pages with the product's own token (?productId=).\n\nRemoved pricing end-to-end: ProductDetailSheet (type/form/save/field),\nProductCreateWizard (state/reset/scan/payload/field), ProductCard (type/display),\nand createProductSchema/updateProductSchema. Not needed to post to channels.\n\nDesign polish: branded channel glyphs (Facebook/Instagram/TikTok/Threads/Pinterest\nmarks on platform colors), refined ChannelCard layout, linked-state accent border.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/71c05a92d5e05b1fd0867d00bf73b5fa658f1e58","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-06-16T05:55:49Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/1cc0d392-fb00-4c26-b1fb-c1edd6932572?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-06-16T05:56:07.462189232Z","updateTime":"2026-06-16T06:00:51.614075Z","labels":{"deployment-tool":"cli-firebase"},"uid":"bf2189b7-00cd-4079-b8c3-f31d39e01863","etag":"h9jshAcBYS80xRg5e72y8LzTzhb7wB732Nqoga8GqT0","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-06-16-008","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-06-16-008","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"var