p,markaestro--markaestro-0226220726.us-central1.hosted.app","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"71c05a92d5e05b1fd0867d00bf73b5fa658f1e58","hash":"71c05a92d5e05b1fd0867d00bf73b5fa658f1e58","commitMessage":"feat(products): separate Facebook/Instagram in edit sheet, remove pricing, polish channels\n\nEdit-product sheet (ProductDetailSheet) now matches the per-product separated model:\n- Meta card is now a per-product 'Facebook' link (its own Facebook login + product-\n  scoped Page picker + Unlink), not the old shared-workspace 'Meta (Facebook +\n  Instagram)' that told users to connect in Settings.\n- Instagram is its own independent link (Instagram Login). Only product-scoped\n  connections count (leftover workspace Meta is ignored).\n- Page picker fetches pages with the product's own token (?productId=).\n\nRemoved pricing end-to-end: ProductDetailSheet (type/form/save/field),\nProductCreateWizard (state/reset/scan/payload/field), ProductCard (type/display),\nand createProductSchema/updateProductSchema. Not needed to post to channels.\n\nDesign polish: branded channel glyphs (Facebook/Instagram/TikTok/Threads/Pinterest\nmarks on platform colors), refined ChannelCard layout, linked-state accent border.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/71c05a92d5e05b1fd0867d00bf73b5fa658f1e58","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-06-16T05:55:49Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/ef155b57-513d-4b25-b85a-e22d6e515e52?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-06-16T06:13:38.370422531Z","updateTime":"2026-06-16T06:18:11.765590Z","displayName":"build-2026-06-16-008","uid":"907c0f28-bb68-4dfc-b5ae-fc66d4df3f7e","etag":"ZPi9N9OvIQPgml34-QyQ9fCHFZioPaT1EnI5I9JpXNc","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaest