 gains an onBack\n  arrow; Escape steps post -> list -> closed\n- Renders as the lg sidebar or the mobile sheet, matching the post\n  detail panel, so no modals stack\n\nAlso sort each day's posts chronologically (the 3 visible chips are now\nthe earliest, not arbitrary API order), wire drag-to-reschedule on day\npanel rows that already showed a grab cursor, and key chips by post id.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/0d52276092b30947d5157968e44916274a94df70","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-08-05T21:14:45Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/b89bd11e-181b-484c-ad8e-f464740d06b7?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-08-05T21:14:52.349633184Z","updateTime":"2026-08-05T21:20:06.187542Z","displayName":"build-2026-08-05-001","uid":"9d384342-2e95-4848-98a0-514b998d7db0","etag":"Yi8gztDL1H0FdUQnDLhulb7XvMIW7b9v1MLHGxvSovo","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-07-01-002","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-07-01-002","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID","value":"227206788749","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]