egacy workspace-level\nMeta user token expired. mergeMetaConnection copied `status` from the\nworkspace connection, so an 'error' user-token status poisoned the\nmerged channel readiness even though Page/IG publishing uses the\nlong-lived Page access token, not the user token.\n\nTake the merged status from the product connection (which owns the\nselected Page + linked IG business account + Page token). Adds a\nregression test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/14d8d77ed0f8a62fa6d05ba3367a27526e73e4d8","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-07-01T07:10:59Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/aad225ed-c14c-4805-9f4d-e678530cd7b0?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-07-01T07:12:31.511310945Z","updateTime":"2026-07-01T07:17:55.401029Z","displayName":"build-2026-07-01-002","uid":"b9585659-c6ab-40fd-a427-5b66ffc3d770","etag":"XouvIhG_Gc1f_qozhNYZ86Oi03NB1UG8bTHv14so-60","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-07-01-001","state":"FAILED","error":{"code":9,"message":"Your application failed to run the framework build command 'npm exec --prefix /layers/google.nodejs.firebasenextjs/npm_modules apphosting-adapter-nextjs-build' successfully. Please check the raw log to address the error and confirm that your application builds locally before redeploying.","details":[{"@type":"type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo","reason":"fah/failed-framework-build","metadata":{"attribution":"USER","user_facing_reason":"Failed Framework Build","user_facing_message":"Your application failed to run the framework build command 'npm exec --prefix /layers/google.nodejs.firebasenextjs/npm_modules apphosting-adapter-nextjs-build' successfully. Please check the raw log to address the error and confirm that yo