nfo.stats and video.list, which TikTok rejects with\na \"scope\" error at the auth step.\n\n- Drop user.info.stats and video.list from the OAuth scope list\n- Swap testConnection fields from follower_count/video_count (stats)\n  to open_id/display_name/avatar_url (basic) so the connection test\n  still works under the reduced scope set\n\nUser/video insights and engagement sync endpoints call APIs that\nrequire the dropped scopes; those features will degrade gracefully\nuntil TikTok approves the extended scopes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/cc81f6c0dc2fff8646cfaa62d02464c0bb0b1378","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-16T07:39:51Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/29691de2-76c4-4cd9-b345-3a6e924d1709?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-04-16T07:39:53.894128770Z","updateTime":"2026-04-16T07:43:46.680586Z","displayName":"build-2026-04-16-002","uid":"ca37c061-c1e2-4925-b558-1c783b9abe10","etag":"nXJ9Zyx259iau2FGirP7Od8C9p_LvT3sINgcU2JJPQ4","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-04-16-003","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-04-16-003","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":4},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app","availability":["BUI