4ib6-Le08\",\"appId\":\"1:227206788749:web:dea0c199026903c4cdd4c4\",\"authDomain\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebaseapp.com\",\"databaseURL\":\"\",\"messagingSenderId\":\"227206788749\",\"projectId\":\"markaestro-0226220726\",\"storageBucket\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"7255e16dcba57e04e5ec3724fe56b32409fe0f1c","hash":"7255e16dcba57e04e5ec3724fe56b32409fe0f1c","commitMessage":"copy(tiktok): reflect inbox-draft reality instead of auto-publish\n\nAfter switching TikTok to MEDIA_UPLOAD, posts land as drafts in the\ncreator's TikTok inbox — they must open the app to finalize caption and\ntap Post. Previous copy still described Direct Post semantics (\"check\nprivate posts, not drafts\") and the 'exported_for_review' status had no\nuser-friendly label. Users saw \"EXPORTED_FOR_REVIEW\" as a raw badge.\n\n- Toasts (CreateTab, DraftsTab, ScheduledTab): describe draft delivery\n  and the manual completion step in the TikTok app\n- ScheduleSheet: when channel=tiktok, show an amber info banner\n  explaining scheduling delivers a draft (does not auto-post)\n- PostCard: add color and friendly label \"In TikTok inbox\" for the\n  'exported_for_review' status\n- Settings / developers API page: replace \"review flow\" / \"review\n  exports\" with \"inbox drafts\" phrasing so creators and API consumers\n  know what to expect\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/7255e16dcba57e04e5ec3724fe56b32409fe0f1c","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-16T08:30:19Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/ead61b57-357a-42d1-8817-e44bf0eba8f2?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-04-16T08:30:21.637886517Z","updateTime":"2026-04-16T08:35:15.163041Z","displayName":"build-