irebaseapp.com\",\"databaseURL\":\"\",\"messagingSenderId\":\"227206788749\",\"projectId\":\"markaestro-0226220726\",\"storageBucket\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"NG_TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS","value":"X-Forwarded-Host","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"NG_ALLOWED_HOSTS","value":"markaestro-227206788749.us-central1.run.app,markaestro-auwks5pljq-uc.a.run.app,t-2366207900---markaestro-auwks5pljq-uc.a.run.app,markaestro--markaestro-0226220726.us-central1.hosted.app","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"f3199c2aba7e8721d814312ca914fe184a9dcd16","hash":"f3199c2aba7e8721d814312ca914fe184a9dcd16","commitMessage":"feat(marketing): AI agent guide, agent-ready API story, and crawler fixes\n\nAdds /developers/agents — a page for people wiring an AI agent to the\npublishing API: the five-call agent loop, a four-command quickstart, six\ncopy-paste JSON Schema tool definitions, a system-prompt brief, four\nrecipes, guardrails, and an error/retry table. Built as a server component\nso it can carry real metadata; the other marketing pages are \"use client\"\nand inherit the root title.\n\nAlso adds public/llms.txt so an agent (or an LLM crawler) can curl the\nwhole contract as plain text.\n\nMarketing polish so the API story is visible outside the docs: nav + footer\nentries, a homepage agent section, an \"API & AI Agents\" feature, a pricing\ncomparison category (API access is not plan-gated — key creation checks\nrole and verified email, never tier), and a banner on the API reference.\n\nThree fixes found along the way:\n\n- /developers/agents would have been behind the auth guard. PUBLIC_PATHS\n  listed /developers/api by exact path; it is now a /developers prefix,\n  mirroring MARKETING_PREFIXES.\n- /robots.txt was being redirected off the marketing apex. With the domain\n  split on, it is not in MARKETING_PATHS, so the apex 307s it to the app\n  host — whose robots.txt disallows everything, which Google then applies\n  to markaestro.com. /robots.txt, /sitemap.xml, and /llms.txt now stay on\n  the apex. robots.ts also advertised a /sitemap.xml that did not exist;\n  sitemap.ts now answers it.\n- The site undersold by three channels. LinkedIn, Threads, and Pinterest\n  have working OAuth, publishing adapters, and composer previews but were\n  missing from the channels page. Added with capabilities read off the\n  adapters, and channel counts corrected (3 -> 6) across the site.\n\nRemoves the fabricated \"trusted by\" company names from the homepage; the\nrow is now a single line with no invented brands.\n\nRestores src/components/marketing/CopyBlock.tsx, which e44c055 swept in by\naccident and 8e4c408 untracked. The agents page, homepage, and features\npage all import it, so the build needs it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F762Pk8pUwVRx68P3doiNN","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/f3199c2aba7e8721d814312ca914fe184a9dcd16","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-08-08T23:41:47Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/fe7360f0-7394-48ef-9b7f-4ea0c92e7d45?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-08-08T23:41:52.366024672Z","updateTime":"2026-08-08T23:46:45.921451Z","displayName":"build-2026-08-08-010","uid":"8fe43481-778a-45d8-a3f7-3e223a5d11c6","etag":"KBcLL2_4OqnH9UExSvmjASHC9t8yafJiQvVpFWn93l4","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-08-08-011","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-08-08-011","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env