hich walks every\nbrand in the workspace and revokes any Page missing from the fetched\nlist. Linking a Page is not a reauthorization and has no business\ntouching other brands, so that call is gone; the OAuth callback, where a\ngenuinely new grant arrives, remains the only caller.\n\nfetchMetaManagedPages under-reported the grant, which is what made the\nsync destructive. It read only the first page of /me/accounts with no\npagination, never checked res.ok — so a rate-limited or failed read\nlooked like an empty grant — and consulted granular asset targets only\nwhen /me/accounts came back empty, hiding Pages that Login for Business\nreports solely as permission targets. It now paginates, checks every\nresponse, unions both sources, and returns `complete` so callers can tell\na full enumeration from a partial one.\n\nThe sync now revokes only when `complete` is true, and no longer revokes\na Page merely because the response carried no access_token: Page tokens\nare long-lived, so it keeps the stored one. A granted Page with no usable\ntoken at all asks to be picked again rather than claiming access was\nwithdrawn.\n\nReconnecting Meta restores brands that were wrongly revoked — the sync\nnow marks any Page still in the grant connected again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/11092f34629ab88a18ad974080df9cd013fc29cd","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-08-08T18:28:40Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/90cb6242-6203-4267-873f-0222a0d6f5fc?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-08-08T18:28:50.181189549Z","updateTime":"2026-08-08T18:32:42.986735Z","displayName":"build-2026-08-08-002","uid":"2e5bdcba-9eb3-465a-a14f-f830910036ff","etag":"EK6d5_yhY84bLjev9pV9RO_IMl7Zuvk9IMm-8hmhtgU","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central