"12675d64b78017c313bf7498fb57237b5b8f4440","hash":"12675d64b78017c313bf7498fb57237b5b8f4440","commitMessage":"feat: app-wide UX overhaul, perf layer, and API key lifecycle hardening\n\nUX overhaul:\n- Implement missing POST /api/products/scan (SSRF-protected HTML metadata\n  extraction) — the website-scan feature 404'd in onboarding and the\n  product wizard; add cancel/retry to the scan flow\n- Add cmd-K command palette (cmdk) replacing the dead header search input\n- Optimistic updates across content tabs and products (delete, publish,\n  schedule, approve, edit) with targeted per-item revert on failure\n- Direct reschedule on scheduled posts + Save & Reschedule in edit sheet\n- Layout-matched skeleton loaders on dashboard, content tabs, analytics\n- Draft autosave to localStorage with restore; Cmd+Enter to publish/save\n- Calendar: URL-persisted filters, failed-post indicators on chips,\n  filter-aware empty states; dashboard channel rows drill into calendar\n- Onboarding: truthful step counter, skippable channels step, auto-detected\n  field badges, trial charge-date clarity, leave protection\n- Settings: honest delete-account state, billing portal in new tab, email\n  change pending pill with resend, invite email validation, scope\n  select-all; billing redirects open in new tab everywhere\n- Verify-email gate auto-polls and actually dismisses (reload() never\n  re-rendered); reduced-motion support; 15s request timeouts\n\nPerceived performance:\n- SWR-lite useApiQuery hook (stale-while-revalidate cache, request dedupe,\n  invalidation) adopted on dashboard, calendar, products, analytics\n- Batch ?productIds= mode on /api/integrations replacing N+1 status fetches\n- Analytics date-range picker (7d/30d/90d) honored where platform APIs\n  genuinely support windows; labels reflect actual range\n\nVerify-email model:\n- Full-screen gate and blanket API block replaced by a slim banner +\n  server-side enforcement on publish/schedule transitions only\n  (EMAIL_NOT_VERIFIED 403); ctx.emailVerified on both auth paths\n\nAPI key lifecycle:\n- Key creation and rotation require verified email; createdEmailVerified\n  provenance snapshot at issuance\n- Optional key expiry (30/90/365d) enforced fail-closed in public API auth\n- Rotation endpoint + settings UI with one-time reveal\n- Stripe webhook revokes keys / disables webhook endpoints on full\n  cancellation, guarded against stale terminal events after resubscribe\n- One-time audit script for pre-existing keys (scripts/audit-api-keys.mjs)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/12675d64b78017c313bf7498fb57237b5b8f4440","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-06-12T06:00:33Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/ae1b8ae0-c2cf-4aaa-9d8b-8a38164ac317?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-06-12T06:01:28.261350152Z","updateTime":"2026-06-12T06:05:51.577218Z","displayName":"build-2026-06-12-001","uid":"f577863c-7992-446d-b545-d827ba978955","etag":"QD_ll260pbMU6_HXiiVoNfa77d98KrKRsO5g9c-IreU","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-06-12-002","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-06-12-002","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app","availa