"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"NG_TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS","value":"X-Forwarded-Host","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"NG_ALLOWED_HOSTS","value":"markaestro-227206788749.us-central1.run.app,markaestro-auwks5pljq-uc.a.run.app,t-162723102---markaestro-auwks5pljq-uc.a.run.app,markaestro--markaestro-0226220726.us-central1.hosted.app","availability":["RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"2886c01c8d5673ccecdc980f00fe57c99b1e8c72","hash":"2886c01c8d5673ccecdc980f00fe57c99b1e8c72","commitMessage":"feat(social): manage live platform posts from the app (list + delete)\n\nAdds an On Platform tab that lists a user's published posts fetched live\nfrom each connected platform and lets them delete where the platform API\nsupports it.\n\n- PlatformAdapter: new listPosts/deletePost methods + PlatformPostSummary\n- Meta: FB page list + delete; IG media list (API has no delete)\n- Threads: list + delete (threads_delete scope added to OAuth config)\n- LinkedIn: author-finder list + DELETE /rest/posts/{urn} with scope checks\n- TikTok: Display API video list (video.list scope added); no delete API\n- Pinterest: pin list + delete\n- New GET/DELETE /api/social/posts route with RBAC, token-refresh retry,\n  and Firestore reconciliation (platformDeletedAt) on delete\n- 39 new unit tests covering all adapters and the route\n\nNote: threads_delete must be enabled on the Threads app and video.list on\nthe TikTok app in their developer dashboards; existing connections need a\nreconnect to grant the new scopes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/2886c01c8d5673ccecdc980f00fe57c99b1e8c72","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-07-03T07:06:13Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/4df0ffc7-c4b2-46ec-ad45-6baec5624f2