l/team/workspace APIs\n\n- Fix authorization bug in approval submit: && operator allowed any workspace\n  user to submit others' drafts; replaced with strict createdBy === uid check\n- Remove duplicate PATCH review handler from approval/route.ts (review/route.ts\n  is the authoritative endpoint used by the client)\n- Fix posts GET to support comma-separated status filter (status=draft,rejected\n  was hitting a literal string match, returning 0 results); now uses Firestore\n  'in' query for multiple statuses\n- Fix workspace creation to use a batch write so workspace doc and owner\n  membership are written atomically (previously an orphaned workspace could\n  exist if the member write failed)\n- Fix ApprovalsTab draft list to only show the current user's own drafts\n  (previously showed all workspace drafts regardless of author)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/a4d4eaa5cc8fb7e0c30e756449899f20156402e7","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-03-30T03:57:04Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/b47ce086-00d0-44f7-9639-792ad30f0526?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-03-30T03:57:10.798687160Z","updateTime":"2026-03-30T04:01:03.631301Z","displayName":"build-2026-03-30-002","uid":"9d601041-147d-4546-bcfa-e6a14eec0e62","etag":"KUPuPaTKNzHP8vqTwt_l3qM81P_rMgCwtwIrLjFi_g0","reconciling":false,"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","errors":[{"error":{"code":13},"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","cloudResource":"https://cloud.google.com/build"}]},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-03-30-001","state":"FAILED","error":{"code":13},"config":{},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"6cb71e9159c22b0edb228d89476e10b3c45b87d7","hash":"6cb71e9159c22b0edb228d89476e10b3c45b87d7","commitMessage":"Remove undeliverable plan features; implement team mgmt, workspaces, approval workflows\n\n- Remove API access, SSO, white-label reporting, custom integrations, priority onboarding call from plans.ts and pricing page\n- Add server-side TEAM_LIMIT_REACHED and WORKSPACE_LIMIT_REACHED error codes\n- Team management API: invite by email, remove member, change role (with RBAC enforcement and plan limits)\n- Workspace management API: create workspace, list all user workspaces (collectionGroup query)\n- Approval workflow API: submit for review, approve/reject with feedback\n- WorkspaceProvider context: workspace switcher persisted to localStorage\n- Workspace switcher dropdown in Sidebar\n- Settings page rewrite: Team, Workspaces, Billing, Integrations tabs\n- ApprovalsTab component with reviewer queue and author queue\n- Approvals tab added to Posts page (FeatureGate: approvalWorkflows)\n- Pricing page: correct annual savings to 18%, update FAQ copy\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/6cb71e9159c22b0edb228d89476e10b3c45b87d7","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-03-30T03:49:25Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/12217f47-fd9c-40f8-bd12-8a769a8f58a8?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-03-30T03:49:30.976931239Z","updateTime":"2026-03-30T03:52:23.026048Z","displayName":"build-2026-03-30-001","uid":"c3a82fe2-5f0a-4627-af2f-95d840aa0c8e","etag":"36OwNP7bdQrujfvbs5DOzYahJWnA_4Kzh-V6_JqXavs","reconciling":false,"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","errors":[{"error":{"code":13},"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","cloudResource":"https://cloud.google.com/build"}]},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-04-22-004","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-04-22-004","con