age":"Generalize the app from Products to Brands (display layer, categories, onboarding, API alias)\n\nPhase 1 — in-app:\n- All user-facing copy renames Product -> Brand (nav, pages, wizard, detail\n  sheet, dialogs, toasts, settings, analytics filters, command palette,\n  platform mockup placeholders, adapter/user-facing server messages).\n  Identifiers, routes, collections, scope IDs, and wire formats unchanged.\n- 9 new brand categories for non-software brands (additive enum).\n- Onboarding opens with \"What are you marketing?\" — tailors the add-brand\n  step copy, seeds a default category, personal brands default to the\n  manual path. Persisted-state key bumped to v4 (step indices shifted).\n\nPhase 2 — marketing site repositioned from application marketing to\n\"every brand you run\"; root metadata updated.\n\nPhase 3 — public API accepts brandId as an alias for productId on post\ncreation (productId wins when both sent); developer docs explain the\nbrand/product wire-format bridge. 5 new schema tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/e707fc5a485160daf08cef9c8590dfb34bae0361","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-07-10T06:55:31Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/aed1dd1c-1454-4bfb-b386-ccd9e767280b?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-07-10T06:56:21.873623310Z","updateTime":"2026-07-10T06:59:54.391903Z","displayName":"build-2026-07-10-002","uid":"023171be-96c5-4e60-985b-e8a0ec6c576d","etag":"AvmwkPffGT_D1hPLfhxl4gcNTzPhKfO2b6EwAnGLOQM","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-07-10-005","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-07-10-005","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"