TE /api/slideshows/[id] — deletes Firestore docs (slideshow +\n  all slides) and Firebase Storage images in one operation\n- Add delete button (trash icon) to both list page (hover-reveal on cards)\n  and detail page header; list page removes card optimistically\n- Fix generation UX: optimistically set status to 'researching' on click so\n  the polling loop starts immediately and progress is visible during the\n  ~5-min generation; replaced misleading 'Starting…' label with 'Generating…'\n- Strengthen buildSlideshowImagePrompt: add a mandatory UGC opening block\n  (section 0) and a final override block (section 10) that bracket the entire\n  prompt so Gemini cannot misinterpret GPT-generated scene context as\n  permission to use studio/frontal photography\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/03852bbd67c60d0dc9c2ecf1e4e88dbacdf93c3a","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-11T20:05:10Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/87ecdbac-f46a-43c0-84a6-a703ce050bb7?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-04-11T20:05:16.461746555Z","updateTime":"2026-04-11T20:09:19.341409Z","displayName":"build-2026-04-11-009","uid":"b56ebafc-d24e-4771-acab-95012a9f37fc","etag":"p1Lhy1UAzkcPoMs9Ipf_1XFOuC21yUwPvQF_FZx6TG4","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-04-11-008","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-04-11-008","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":4},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD