\",\"storageBucket\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"590fd1fdd2e17a6adf7f8fdc00edcdae2f01d5d9","hash":"590fd1fdd2e17a6adf7f8fdc00edcdae2f01d5d9","commitMessage":"fix: stop GPT-generated studio prompts overriding UGC style in slideshow images\n\nThe primary cause was `buildSlideshowImagePrompt()` labelling the\nGPT-generated imagePrompt as \"source of truth — execute this scene\",\nwhich told Gemini to defer to whatever GPT wrote (e.g. professional\nstudio portraits) even though the camera-angle and environment sections\nexplicitly ban studio setups.\n\nChanges:\n- image-generator.ts: Relabel section 2 so the GPT scene brief\n  describes WHAT to show; camera angle, environment, and style rules\n  that follow explicitly override any professional/studio framing\n- generator.ts: Add three ❌/✅ concrete image prompt examples to the\n  BASE_SYSTEM_PROMPT so GPT-4o-mini has unambiguous anti-studio anchors\n- generator.ts: Tighten the imagePrompt field description in the JSON\n  schema template to mandate behind-back/side-profile/over-shoulder\n  angles and real locations instead of the vague \"detailed photo scene\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/590fd1fdd2e17a6adf7f8fdc00edcdae2f01d5d9","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-11T11:13:16Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/0653caec-3178-4130-8ade-b9064113b481?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-04-11T11:13:21.727332120Z","updateTime":"2026-04-11T11:17:34.802144Z","displayName":"build-2026-04-11-007","uid":"da8289c1-ba86-4172-9b74-2e4497b0d897","etag":"JIzQlXxLFrAyS2VdUgSQwkEp__LJ5Pbx9vCDEWJF1gw","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/m