"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"68d8072f331d82bd56b13dd28fef16dfb2e42968","hash":"68d8072f331d82bd56b13dd28fef16dfb2e42968","commitMessage":"Add TikTok slideshow generation feature (ReelFarm-style)\n\nIntroduces a first-class slideshow domain on top of the existing Next.js +\nFirebase + AI stack. Slideshows are AI-generated TikTok carousel assets\n(3–10 slides, 9:16) created from a product + prompt and exported into the\nstandard posts publish pipeline.\n\n## What's new\n\n### Domain layer (src/lib/slideshows/)\n- types.ts: SlideshowDoc, SlideDoc, domain type helpers\n- firestore.ts: collection refs, serializeSlideshowDoc, serializeSlideDoc\n- generator.ts: GPT-4o-mini slide-brief generation with self-repair retry;\n  each brief includes copy, imagePrompt, and structured visualIntent\n- quality.ts: buildVisualSignature (diversity fingerprint), buildSlideQuality\n  (hookStrength, readability, distinctiveness, visualClarity scores)\n- export.ts: assertSlideshowExportable (TikTok constraints + caption length +\n  imageStatus check), buildExportedSlideshowPost\n\n### API routes (src/app/api/slideshows/)\n- POST/GET /api/slideshows — create draft, list with optional status filter\n- GET/PATCH /api/slideshows/:id — detail + slides, update fields/slides\n- POST /api/slideshows/:id/generate — 3-phase orchestration (researching →\n  generating_slides → generating_images → ready); drain-queue concurrency=2;\n  partial image failure doesn't abort the batch\n- POST /api/slideshows/:id/export — atomic Firestore transaction (post.set +\n  slideshow.update); returns postId\n- POST /api/slideshows/:id/slides/:slideId/regenerate-image — per-slide image\n  regeneration with quality recomputation against the full slide set\n\n### Image generation upgrades (src/lib/ai/image-generator.ts)\n- SlideContext type (index, totalSlides, kind, safeTextRegion, visualIntent,\n  previousVisualSignatures) threaded through ImageGenRequest\n- buildSlideshowImagePrompt: slide-role-aware prompt with safe-text-zone rules\n  (top/middle/bottom), diversity enforcement via previousVisualSignatures, and\n  TikTok-native 9:16 composition guidance\n- Slideshow mode bypasses interpretSceneIntent (visualIntent already structured)\n\n### TikTok publish compatibility (Tasks 14)\n- photo_cover_index now driven by slideshowCoverIndex instead of hardcoded 0;\n  PublishRequest gains photoCoverIndex field; publisher wires it at both call\n  sites; TikTok adapter uses it in the PULL_FROM_URL body\n- Export rejects slides with imageStatus:'failed' even when a stale imageUrl\n  exists (previous check only tested imageUrl presence)\n- Export validates caption ≤ 4000 chars (TikTok API hard limit) with a\n  descriptive VALIDATION_SLIDESHOW_CAPTION_TOO_LONG error\n\n### Schema extensions (src/lib/schemas.ts)\n- Slideshow enums: slideshowChannels, slideshowStatuses, slideshowRenderModes,\n  slideKinds, slideImageStatuses, safeTextRegions\n- slideVisualIntentSchema, slideQualitySchema, slideshowSlideSchema,\n  createSlideshowSchema, updateSlideshowSchema\n- createPostSchema/updatePostSchema extended with sourceType, slideshowId,\n  slideshowTitle, slideshowSlideCount, slideshowCoverIndex\n\n### Public API (src/lib/public-api/)\n- serializePublicPost already handled slideshow fields; added PublicPostResponse\n  type in schemas.ts documenting the full serialized shape\n\n### UI (src/app/slideshows/)\n- SlideshowStatusBadge: status dot + label with color coding\n- SlideshowCreateSheet: product picker, prompt, slide count, style, provider\n- /slideshows list page: grid with status filter, empty state, create CTA\n- SlideCard: 9:16 image preview, kind badge, quality bars, hover regenerate\n- SlideListEditor: sorted grid wrapper\n- /slideshows/:id detail page: caption editor, generate/export actions, 3s\n  polling while running, optimistic slide image updates\n- CreateTab: TikTok-contextual \"Try Slideshows\" promo banner\n- nav.ts: Slideshows added under Marketing group\n\n### Tests (98 total, all passing)\n- slideshows-schemas.test.ts, slideshows-quality.test.ts,\n  slideshows-generator.test.ts (13 tests), slideshows-export.test.ts (11 tests)\n\n### Docs\n- docs/SLIDESHOWS.md: architecture diagram, file map, state machine, pipeline\n  internals, TikTok compatibility notes, API reference, extension guide\n- Inline JSDoc on generator.ts, quality.ts, firestore.ts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/68d8072f331d82bd56b13dd28fef16dfb2e42968","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-11T03:58:11Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/f1151d7e-c387-4cd2-9fb6-18b29f63f910?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-04-11T03:58:19.067614063Z","updateTime":"2026-04-11T04:03:42.967845Z","displayName":"build-2026-04-11-001","uid":"5ea88742-5cbc-495c-8f4b-4280e00c534e","etag":"wh4EBqT0-3za4FDr97duNcQ4Wv6Ny5psQIodRl2Ns9c","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-04-11-003","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-04-11-003","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":4},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID","value":"22720