"},{"variable":"FIREBASE_CONFIG","value":"{\"databaseURL\":\"\",\"projectId\":\"markaestro-0226220726\",\"storageBucket\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"FIREBASE_WEBAPP_CONFIG","value":"{\"apiKey\":\"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08\",\"appId\":\"1:227206788749:web:dea0c199026903c4cdd4c4\",\"authDomain\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebaseapp.com\",\"databaseURL\":\"\",\"messagingSenderId\":\"227206788749\",\"projectId\":\"markaestro-0226220726\",\"storageBucket\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"6cd4aa480a03ad22c1e91996c3c11d700618b7ff","hash":"6cd4aa480a03ad22c1e91996c3c11d700618b7ff","commitMessage":"Implement slideshow overhaul Tasks 5–8: character models, multi-step creation flow\n\nTask 5 — 20 pre-generated character models\n- Add 20 character model specs (definitions.ts) covering 5 ethnicities, 3 genders,\n  4 age ranges, 3 body sizes, and 5 style clusters (casual/professional/fitness/\n  lifestyle/streetwear)\n- Add Firestore helpers for the global characterModels collection (firestore.ts)\n- Add seed script (scripts/seed-character-models.ts): generates 3 Gemini portrait\n  reference shots per model, uploads to Firebase Storage, writes Firestore docs;\n  safe to re-run (skips existing), supports --force flag\n- Fix seed script Firebase init to use the same startsWith('{') guard as\n  firebase-admin.ts so placeholder env values fall through to ADC correctly\n\nTask 6 — Character model picker UI\n- Add CharacterModelPicker component: 3-col thumbnail grid with gender/style filters\n  and a \"No character model\" option; loads from /api/character-models\n- Add GET /api/character-models route returning all active models\n\nTask 7 — Character consistency in image generation\n- Add characterModel field to ImageGenRequest with modelId, name, description,\n  referenceImageUrls, and prefetchedImages\n- When characterModel is present, download reference images (up to 4), prepend to\n  Gemini multimodal contents array, and inject CHARACTER CONSISTENCY instruction\n- Add prefetchedImages optimisation: generate route now fetches character reference\n  images once before the slide image loop and passes base64 data in sharedImageReq,\n  reducing HTTP fetches from N×refs to refs (3 fetches for 10 slides vs 30)\n- Add characterModelDescription to GenerateSlideshowInput; injected into GPT-4o-mini\n  prompt so image prompts reference the model by name and action rather than appearance\n\nTask 8 — Multi-step slideshow creation flow\n- Rewrite SlideshowCreateSheet as a 3-step sheet: Format → Model → Details\n- Step 1: 6 story format cards with emoji, label, description, and checkmark\n- Step 2: CharacterModelPicker with filters\n- Step 3: product, prompt, slide count, image style, image provider; summary chips\n  to jump back to earlier steps\n- Wire characterModelId and storyFormat through createSlideshowSchema, POST\n  /api/slideshows, SlideshowDoc, and the generate route\n\nSchemas / types\n- Add characterModelSchema and exported types (CharacterModel, CharacterModelGender,\n  CharacterModelStyle) to schemas.ts\n- Add storyFormats enum and StoryFormat type\n- Add characterModelId: string | null to SlideshowDoc\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/6cd4aa480a03ad22c1e91996c3c11d700618b7ff","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-11T06:17:14Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/3d4792af-320e-45f8-bb6e-15528a3a3856?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-04-11T06:17:20.609203082Z","updateTime":"2026-04-11T06:22:14.106928Z","displayName":"build-2026-04-11-002","uid":"e8cdaeee-99a6-4b0f-8c67-e04f2697c5a0","etag":"nPFoo2a7zMU