essage":"diag(posts): log the field/code behind a post-create validation 400\n\nThe stale-channel fix didn't clear a repeat failure with an identical\nresponse size, meaning either it wasn't the real cause or the reporting\nclient was still running pre-deploy JS. Neither is distinguishable from\noutside — Zod issue messages aren't logged today (by design, to avoid\nechoing request content), so there's no way to see which field actually\nfailed. Log field paths and Zod/issue codes only, never the message\ntext, so the next occurrence is diagnosable without guessing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/88b3a86b01f353c8ec85005c3bd8e70f8b5d791a","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-08-12T01:07:51Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/3b50c4a9-f019-400c-9bf0-9f3dbce568c1?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-08-12T01:07:54.415002474Z","updateTime":"2026-08-12T01:13:18.379035Z","displayName":"build-2026-08-12-001","uid":"d0eee5d4-b060-408e-808a-338661cb95cb","etag":"cRTTUpYoIxNanb-r85U6hXDYPCpKZbH_IOFidbvw36I","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-08-12-004","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-08-12-004","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":1024,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":10},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"markaestro-022622