550d0b10","commitMessage":"feat: redesign calendar with platform mockups and split-view panel\n\n- Split-view layout: calendar shrinks to make room for inline detail panel\n  (no Sheet overlay — panel slides in alongside the calendar)\n- Left-border colored event chips per channel (Instagram pink, X black,\n  Facebook blue, TikTok red) with status dot and truncated preview\n- Platform-accurate post mockups in the detail panel:\n  · Instagram: story ring, full square image, like/comment/share/save row\n  · X/Twitter: avatar, display name/handle, tweet text, image, action row\n  · Facebook: profile pic, post text, image, like/comment/share bar\n  · TikTok: 9:16 phone frame with overlay caption, spinning disc, actions\n- If a post has mediaUrls, the image renders in the mockup\n- Ad campaign panel: budget, dates, creative image/headline if present\n- Smooth slide-in animation for detail panel (slideInRight keyframe)\n- Legend with channel color bars + status dots\n- Today's date highlighted with filled circle\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/c1ff76cbad150f5609c626c7e4ab58a6550d0b10","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-03-17T06:37:48Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/6a4f7e72-b4b8-4f58-bc7a-f243d2f09d5b?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-03-17T06:37:50.681434370Z","updateTime":"2026-05-22T22:41:27.408632Z","displayName":"build-2026-03-17-007","uid":"b876acd3-6feb-4783-bf74-a6c7ec3ebba6","etag":"J9z31aY1nSe1ibbUKUoONLwt1cu5SYw1_V3bFIMXQcY","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-03-17-004","state":"EXPIRED","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-03-17-004","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concur