nnection as\nconnected even though graph.instagram.com hard-refused the token from\nthe first second (long-lived exchange AND /me both returned IGApiException\ncode 100) — the account isn't eligible for the Instagram API (personal,\nnon-Professional account). The connection kept the 1-hour short-lived\ntoken and an app-scoped user id, guaranteeing every publish would fail.\n\n- instagram-errors: add isInstagramGraphRefusal — after the GET→POST\n  retry, a method-type code-100 error IS the blanket refusal\n- oauth callback: a hard-refused exchange + failed profile read now\n  fails the connect with the actionable \"connect your Facebook Page /\n  use a Professional account\" message instead of storing a dud\n- meta adapter: resolve the professional user_id via GET /me at publish\n  time (older connections stored the app-scoped token id); map refusals\n  on /me, container create, and media_publish to the actionable message\n- publisher: mark the instagram connection revoked on a publish-time\n  refusal so the channel tile flips to \"reconnect\" automatically\n- token-refresh: health-check instagram connections stored without\n  tokenExpiresAt (previously skipped forever — dead tokens stayed\n  'connected'); treat refusals as permanent; fix \"[object Object]\" in\n  stored refresh errors\n- tests: instagram error classification + Instagram Login publish paths\n- scripts/diagnose-meta-connections.mjs: read-only live diagnostics for\n  all Meta-family connections (token decrypt + Graph probes)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/b13fe4629fbb2b6728c5509280206ceb27c3e304","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysa@aethossolutions.com"},"commitTime":"2026-07-02T02:32:48Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/77c61e74-8ffb-4f61-9212-df9f4e873a90?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-07-02T02:32:51.135720048Z","updateTime":"2026-0