paigns as AdCampaignDoc with launchedAt set (already live)\n- Immediately fetches and stores lifetime metrics + first history snapshot\n  for each imported campaign\n- Returns { imported, skipped, failed } counts\n\nFrontend:\n- \"Import Existing\" button added next to \"New Campaign\" in PageHeader\n- Import dialog: platform selector, one-click import, results breakdown\n  showing imported / already existed / failed counts\n- Toast feedback on success, with campaign list refresh\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/45c6801a974a8201b74627cad2bb47eeacf864ef","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-06T23:36:36Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/4bf5ff88-8914-4a1b-a9d1-faed3d32d466?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-04-06T23:37:42.051008710Z","updateTime":"2026-04-06T23:41:44.980491Z","displayName":"build-2026-04-06-012","uid":"5a6e9908-3fbd-4335-835a-6644cc82e2dc","etag":"aDX2dZGn0UgDF_SO3oWU1V2y-NKlQdEKACEkhnjhJy4","reconciling":false},{"name":"projects/markaestro-0226220726/locations/us-central1/backends/markaestro/builds/build-2026-04-06-010","state":"READY","image":"us-central1-docker.pkg.dev/markaestro-0226220726/firebaseapphosting-images/markaestro:build-2026-04-06-010","config":{"runConfig":{"cpu":1,"memoryMib":512,"concurrency":80,"maxInstances":4},"env":[{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY","value":"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN","value":"markaestro.com","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID","value":"markaestro-0226220726","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET","value":"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"]},{"variable":"NEXT