ml"},{"variable":"TIKTOK_ADS_CLIENT_KEY","secret":"projects/227206788749/secrets/TIKTOK_ADS_CLIENT_KEY/versions/2","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"],"origin":"APPHOSTING_YAML","originFileName":"apphosting.yaml"},{"variable":"TIKTOK_ADS_CLIENT_SECRET","secret":"projects/227206788749/secrets/TIKTOK_ADS_CLIENT_SECRET/versions/1","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"],"origin":"APPHOSTING_YAML","originFileName":"apphosting.yaml"},{"variable":"FIREBASE_CONFIG","value":"{\"databaseURL\":\"\",\"projectId\":\"markaestro-0226220726\",\"storageBucket\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"FIREBASE_WEBAPP_CONFIG","value":"{\"apiKey\":\"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08\",\"appId\":\"1:227206788749:web:dea0c199026903c4cdd4c4\",\"authDomain\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebaseapp.com\",\"databaseURL\":\"\",\"messagingSenderId\":\"227206788749\",\"projectId\":\"markaestro-0226220726\",\"storageBucket\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"f3f9dc67f901631c0123d6fcbf646449991eeb89","hash":"f3f9dc67f901631c0123d6fcbf646449991eeb89","commitMessage":"Add rich metrics, trend history, post engagement, and AI insights overhaul\n\nLayer 1 — Richer metrics collection:\n- AdCampaignMetrics type expanded with roas, conversionValue, reach,\n  frequency, videoViews, videoWatchTime\n- Google Ads: now fetches conversions_value; derives ROAS\n- Meta: now fetches reach, frequency, video_play_actions, action_values\n  (purchase revenue); derives ROAS and frequency\n- TikTok: now fetches reach, video_play_actions, average_video_play_per_user,\n  total_purchase_value; derives ROAS and frequency\n- MetricsSnapshot type added for time-series storage\n\nLayer 2 — Time-series metric history:\n- Sync route now writes a daily snapshot to metrics_history subcollection\n  (keyed YYYY-MM-DD) alongside the main campaign doc update\n- History is preserved across syncs instead of being overwritten\n\nLayer 3 — Post engagement feedback loop:\n- New POST /api/posts/[id]/sync-engagement route\n- Meta: fetches likes, comments, shares, reach, impressions via Graph API\n  using page access token\n- TikTok: fetches view_count, like_count, comment_count, share_count,\n  average_time_watched via Content API v2\n- Stores engagement object on the post doc\n\nLayer 3 — AI insights overhaul (both routes):\n- Upgraded from gpt-4o-mini → gpt-4o\n- Added hardcoded benchmark reference table (Meta/Google/TikTok, sourced\n  from WordStream, HubSpot, platform-published benchmarks 2024)\n- Per-campaign route now loads 7-day metrics_history and builds trend\n  summary showing direction and % change for all key metrics\n- Per-campaign prompt now includes ROAS, conversion rate, CPC, reach,\n  frequency, video metrics, and cost-per-conversion\n- Aggregate route now includes real post engagement totals and top post\n- Both routes use response_format json_object and temperature 0.2 for\n  consistency; model instructed not to invent numbers outside the reference\n\nFrontend:\n- Summary strip expanded from 4 → 6 cards (adds Conversions, Overall ROAS)\n- Campaign cards now show CPC, ROAS, Conversions, and Frequency\n- Campaign detail dialog expanded to 3 metric rows: core stats, conversion\n  stats (CPC/conversions/conv rate/ROAS), and a conditional third row for\n  reach/frequency/video/watch time + revenue/cost-per-conversion\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/f3f9dc67f901631c0123d6fcbf646449991eeb89","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-06T23:10:48Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/3098e726-5b99-490b-b691-8c2c3c447f71?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-04-06T23:10:57.185712225Z","up