leName":"apphosting.yaml"},{"variable":"FIREBASE_CONFIG","value":"{\"databaseURL\":\"\",\"projectId\":\"markaestro-0226220726\",\"storageBucket\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD","RUNTIME"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"},{"variable":"FIREBASE_WEBAPP_CONFIG","value":"{\"apiKey\":\"AIzaSyBSyzoIBbqmk9iBBE2qu4fzcw4ib6-Le08\",\"appId\":\"1:227206788749:web:dea0c199026903c4cdd4c4\",\"authDomain\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebaseapp.com\",\"databaseURL\":\"\",\"messagingSenderId\":\"227206788749\",\"projectId\":\"markaestro-0226220726\",\"storageBucket\":\"markaestro-0226220726.firebasestorage.app\"}","availability":["BUILD"],"origin":"FIREBASE_SYSTEM"}]},"source":{"codebase":{"branch":"main","displayName":"95d60fac15e184bd57bfb3997201316cdcedb1a2","hash":"95d60fac15e184bd57bfb3997201316cdcedb1a2","commitMessage":"perf(tiktok): skip 12s inline poll on inbox publish\n\nInbox uploads never terminate within TikTok's synchronous 12s window —\nstatus stays in PROCESSING_* for minutes to hours before flipping to\nSEND_TO_USER_INBOX. The inline wait was pure latency tax on every\npublish API response with no happy-path value.\n\nReturn pending immediately after the upload chunks confirm (video) or\nafter init returns a publish_id (photo). The background fast-poll at\n/api/worker/tiktok-poll catches terminal status within ~60s and\ntransitions the post to exported_for_review or failed.\n\nTrade-off: a malformed-video FAILED now surfaces in ~60s via the poll\ninstead of synchronously in the publish response. Acceptable — the\nexisting flow already sets pending for every real success case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/95d60fac15e184bd57bfb3997201316cdcedb1a2","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-21T23:39:22Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-c