d expand channel surface\n\n- Add /api/worker/tiktok-poll with a dedicated 1-min Cloud Scheduler job\n  that polls pending TikTok publishes twice per invocation (30s apart),\n  so drafts flip to SEND_TO_USER_INBOX within ~30s instead of waiting\n  for the next main tick. Also bump the main worker-tick schedule from\n  every 2 min to every 1 min.\n- Add threads, pinterest, and youtube to the oauth/social channel enums\n  and register their provider configs and redirect envs.\n- Enrich Facebook/Instagram insights with profile fields (avatar,\n  username, bio, verified, follows) and richer post/media metrics\n  (views, reach, shares, saves); surface them in analytics cards and\n  top-post lists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/6d88669a7487d85757240bf874861e864f69aff3","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-04-21T05:51:44Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/d64c004b-490f-4964-8637-19264ca5d15d?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-04-21T05:51:49.484034962Z","updateTime":"2026-04-21T05:55:42.211360Z","displayName":"build-2026-04-21-001","uid":"05a481a9-a14c-4d52-b0ff-6914df59f6e7","etag":"3Od5QOTmOkZWBLVqt05e9UW2VKxzdUmfabWOfRIbC6c","reconciling":false,"errorSource":"CLOUD_BUILD","errors":[{"error":{"code":9,"message":"Your application failed to run the framework build command 'npm exec --prefix /layers/google.nodejs.firebasenextjs/npm_modules apphosting-adapter-nextjs-build' successfully. Please check the raw log to address the error and confirm that your application builds locally before redeploying.","details":[{"@type":"type.googleapis.com/google.rpc.ErrorInfo","reason":"fah/failed-framework-build","metadata":{"attribution":"USER","user_facing_reason":"Failed Framework Build","user_facing_message":"Your application failed to run the framework build command 'np