y and wrap-break-word on PostCard content\n- Add SheetTitle/SheetDescription to Header mobile nav for accessibility\n- Rewrite Settings page to be user-focused: remove token expiry, OAuth\n  implementation details, and technical jargon\n- Remove Security section and nav links from landing page\n- Update NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL to https://markaestro.com for production\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","uri":"https://github.com/D3vBaba/Markaestro/commit/518466b2860138c0d1ac8c878e069b0f58c763e4","author":{"displayName":"Rodney Sama-Ambe","email":"rodneysama-ambe@Rodneys-Mac-mini.local"},"commitTime":"2026-03-23T21:35:21Z"}},"buildLogsUri":"https://console.cloud.google.com/cloud-build/builds;region=us-central1/f1987ab5-3f34-457d-a1f2-44816c86b6af?project=227206788749","createTime":"2026-03-23T21:35:28.818052472Z","updateTime":"2026-05-22T22:41:27.408632Z","displayName":"build-2026-03-23-001","uid":"e5af9797-2c0f-4662-9524-94eb28a23838","etag":"kRC_Lt44SA8MsWf_2Vs2s0XdPSAnjNjMvgLJ7N5fJ6g","reconciling":false}]}
